Plain `git blame` credits "Fiona Formatter" with 32 lines, because the reformat commit rewrote them. Those lines really belong to the people above. The ignored-reformat count gives a truer picture.

Some contributors from the log, such as DracoBlue, Typicode, Tomek Kopczuk and Damien Klinnert, no longer have any surviving lines. Their changes were rewritten or removed later.

